# Barbed Servitor: "Whenever this creature is dealt damage, target opponent loses that much life." Damage dealt to it by several sources at the same time is one trigger for the
# total (CR 603.2c, 120.2; the card's rulings): Bot2 blocks the menace Servitor with both Memnites, they deal 1 each, and Bot2 loses 2 life, not 1 twice. The Servitor deals its
# 1 damage to a Memnite, not to a player, so Bot1 draws nothing and loses nothing, and is indestructible.

